isting/TS639276679206430000/reb10/highres/9/E4513069_40.jpg"],"remarks":"The primary bedroom alone is reason enough to take a closer look at this beautifully renovated Bannerman townhome! Exceptionally spacious, this impressive retreat offers the feel of two rooms in one, with plenty of space for a king sized bed AND a private sitting area, home office or reading nook. It's a feature rarely found in a home of this size! Renovated across all three levels, this 3 bedroom, 2 bathroom home showcases a thoughtful blend of contemporary finishes and soft sage green accents that create a warm, inviting atmosphere. The bright living room and updated kitchen feature stylish cabinetry, stainless steel appliances and modern finishes. Two additional bedrooms complete the upper level, while the finished basement offers valuable additional living space. Outside, enjoy a private fenced backyard with freshly laid sod, ready for summer. Close to schools, parks, shopping and transit, this is a home with more to offer than meets the eye. Come experience the space for yourself! (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$219,999"],["Type","Townhouse"],["Bedrooms","3"],["Bathrooms","2"],["Half bathrooms","1"],["Living area","1,079 sq ft"],["Lot size","2,690 sq ft"],["Year built","1979"],["Storeys","2"],["Condo fee","$340 monthly"],["Neighbourhood","Bannerman"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T5Y1N1"],["MLS® number","E4513069"],["Listed","October 15, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Hood Fan, Window Coverings, Fan"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Basement","Finished, Full"],["Parking","Stall"],["Condo fee includes","Exterior Maintenance, Property Management, Insurance, Other, See Remarks"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","5.62 m × 3.58 m (18'5\" × 11'9\")"],["Dining room","Main level","3.49 m × 2.36 m (11'5\" × 7'9\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","3.19 m × 2.36 m (10'6\" × 7'9\")"],["Family room","Basement","4.68 m × 3.64 m (15'4\" × 11'11\")"],["P